  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a860c39d3bee20a4dbf1652f7a813971, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    answer: The archive on the hill. Three readers today. One will not return.
    mismatchAnswer: The school on Chavchavadze Street. Twenty years teaching children literature.
    uncannyAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    answer: None. I sleep well. Though I dreamt something I had no right to know.
    mismatchAnswer: Nothing. Past sixty, a little stiffness. Nothing more than that.
    uncannyAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
  - I read one page three times. It said something different each time.
  - That window behind you. I would not stand so close to it.
